 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "回到开头的冷钱包。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的冷钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "六把钥匙里，WazirX 持五把，Liminal 持一把。",
   "spoken": "六把钥匙里，WazirX 持五把，Liminal 持一把。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.22,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 4.318,
   "speechEnd": 7.913
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "签名人在 Liminal 界面上看到的交易，和实际签下的不一样。",
   "spoken": "签名人在 Liminal 界面上看到的交易，和实际签下的不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.952,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 9.05,
   "speechEnd": 12.942
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "实际签下的，是一次合约升级，钱包控制权被转走。",
   "spoken": "实际签下的，是一次合约升级，钱包控制权被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.996,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 14.094,
   "speechEnd": 18.296
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "接手的是一个恶意合约，它提前 8 天就部署好。",
   "spoken": "接手的是一个恶意合约，它提前 8 天就部署好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.328,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 19.426,
   "speechEnd": 22.664
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "WazirX 称，问题出在 Liminal 界面显示的数据。",
   "spoken": "WazirX 称，问题出在 Liminal 界面显示的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 23.724,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 23.822,
   "speechEnd": 27.429
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "Liminal 称，自己的基础设施没有被攻破，是受害方的 3 台机器被注入恶意载荷。",
   "spoken": "Liminal 称，自己的基础设施没有被攻破，是受害方的 3 台机器被注入恶意载贺。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.48,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 28.578,
   "speechEnd": 34.613
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "这一争议，没有见到最终的独立报告。",
   "spoken": "这一争议，没有见到最终的独立报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.684,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 35.782,
   "speechEnd": 38.829
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "多签只保证，足够多的人同意某个哈希。",
   "spoken": "多签只保证，足够多的人同意某个哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.888,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 39.986,
   "speechEnd": 43.117
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "它不管这个哈希，代表的是哪一笔交易。",
   "spoken": "它不管这个哈希，代表的是哪一笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.188,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 44.286,
   "speechEnd": 47.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "签名人看到的和实际签的不一样，每把钥匙都会正常工作。",
   "spoken": "签名人看到的和实际签的不一样，每把钥匙都会正常工作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 48.488,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 48.586,
   "speechEnd": 53.514
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "防线在签名人自己这一侧。",
   "spoken": "防线在签名人自己这一侧。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.588,
   "dur": 2.736,
   "speechStart": 54.686,
   "speechEnd": 56.483
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "每个签名人，在自己的设备上，用另一套代码，独立算一遍交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "每个签名人，在自己的设备上，用另一套代码，独立算一遍交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 57.544,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 57.642,
   "speechEnd": 63.106
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "再在硬件钱包屏幕上，核对收款地址、金额、数据和操作类型。",
   "spoken": "再在硬件钱包屏幕上，核对收款地址、金额、数据和操作类型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 64.172,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 64.27,
   "speechEnd": 70.103
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "设备把交易解析成人能读懂的字段再签，这叫清晰签名。",
   "spoken": "设备把交易解析成人能读懂的字段再签，这叫清晰签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.16,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 71.258,
   "speechEnd": 75.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "例行转账，操作类型应该是 CALL。",
   "spoken": "例行转账，操作类型应该是 CALL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 76.972,
   "dur": 3.576,
   "speechStart": 77.07,
   "speechEnd": 79.736
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "如果是 DELEGATECALL，就是让多签合约执行外部代码，不签。",
   "spoken": "如果是 DELEGATECALL，就是让多签合约执行外部代码，不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 80.768,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 80.866,
   "speechEnd": 85.675
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "大额交易，再用电话或当面，确认发起人身份。",
   "spoken": "大额交易，再用电话或当面，确认发起人身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 86.724,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 86.822,
   "speechEnd": 90.691
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "签名人不能共用一台电脑、一个浏览器、一个前端，共用就是单点。",
   "spoken": "签名人不能共用一台电脑、一个浏览器、一个前端，共用就是单点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 91.744,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 91.842,
   "speechEnd": 97.032
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "局限是，如果所有人用同一个解码工具，这个工具就是新的单点。",
   "spoken": "局限是，如果所有人用同一个解码工具，这个工具就是新的单点。",
